      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Georgetown%2C_Prince_Edward_Island",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A seasonal powerhouse, Seafood 2000’s plant—originally built by National Sea Products—processes thousands of tonnes of fish each year.",
